{"id":"wb-1-125","name":"西安碑林","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"西安碑林","text":"西安碑林位于中华人民共和国陕西省西安市三学街西安府文庙旧址，是一座收藏、研究碑石墓志及其它古代石刻艺术品的博物馆，是西安碑林博物馆的主体。碑林中荟萃了中国古代精美碑石艺术，石碑众多，还有丰富的碑石墓志、石刻艺术品。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%A5%BF%E5%AE%89%E7%A2%91%E6%9E%97","revisionId":95104839,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95104839","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f04594a4c10b16ceeed4fd26.jpg","title":"碑林10号.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%A2%91%E6%9E%9710%E5%8F%B7.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9e/%E7%A2%91%E6%9E%9710%E5%8F%B7.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"蒋亦炯","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"该照片的内容为中国全国重点文物保护单位。编号： CNSN-029-003","width":320,"height":213}}